sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant P as 💻 producer.py
    participant B as 🐰 RabbitMQ Broker (:5672)
    participant CC as 🚨 consumer_critical.py
    participant CT as 📊 consumer_telemetry.py

    Note over P,B: FASE 1: Handshake, Topología y Publicación
    P->>B: Protocol-Header 0-9-1 + Connection.Open (Channel 0)
    P->>B: Channel.Open (Channel 1)
    P->>B: Exchange.Declare + Queue.Declare (x2) + Queue.Bind (x2)
    P->>B: Basic.Publish + Content-Header (delivery_mode=2) + Content-Body [0xCE] (x3)
    Note over B: Topic Exchange enruta:<br/>2 msgs -> cola_telemetria<br/>1 msg -> cola_alarmas

    Note over B,CC: FASE 2: Consumidor Crítico (Manual ACK + QoS)
    CC->>B: Basic.Qos (prefetch_count=1)
    CC->>B: Basic.Consume (cola_alarmas, no-ack=False)
    B->>CC: Basic.Deliver (delivery_tag=1) [Estado en Broker: UNACKED]
    Note over CC: Procesando en BD (4 segundos)...
    CC->>B: Basic.Ack (delivery_tag=1) [Broker elimina el mensaje]

    Note over B,CT: FASE 3: Consumidor Telemetría (Auto ACK / Ráfaga)
    CT->>B: Basic.Consume (cola_telemetria, no-ack=True)
    B->>CT: Basic.Deliver (x2 en ráfaga) [Broker elimina al enviar]
    Note over CT,B: Sin paquetes Basic.Ack (Ahorro de red)
